<title>HONG KONG: Lam Soon, M.C Packaging shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Lam Soon, M.C Packaging shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Lam Soon (Hong Kong) Ltd and its subsidiary M.C. Packaging (Hong Kong) Ltd were suspended at the companies' request pending an announcement, the stock exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Lam Soon shares ended unchanged at HK$1.35 on Wednesday while M.C. Packaging shares fell HK$0.075 to HK$2.575.</p>
<p>Lam Soon had said earlier this week that it was in talks with two overseas-based companies regarding the sale of its 51.2 percent interest in M.C. Packaging and a that final decision would be made shortly.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
